.Dd October 26, 2026
.Dt NVSO 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nvso_domain_create ,
.Nm nvso_map ,
.Nm nvssd_queue_export ,
.Nm nvgpu_dma_post ,
.Nm nvso_domain_gate ,
.Nm nvso_irq_attach
.Nd kernel methods for nvso(4) (research)
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/nvso_if.h
.Ft int
.Fn nvso_domain_create "struct nvso_softc *sc" "struct nvso_domain_create_req *req"
.Ft int
.Fn nvso_map "struct nvso_softc *sc" "struct nvso_map_req *req"
.Ft int
.Fn nvssd_queue_export "struct nvso_softc *sc" "struct nvssd_queue_export_req *req"
.Ft int
.Fn nvgpu_dma_post "struct nvso_softc *sc" "struct nvgpu_dma_post_req *req"
.Ft int
.Fn nvso_domain_gate "struct nvso_softc *sc" "struct nvso_domain_gate_req *req"
.Ft int
.Fn nvso_irq_attach "struct nvso_softc *sc" "struct nvso_irq_attach_req *req"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These methods implement the kernel side of the
.Xr nvso 4
ioctl ABI.
They are dispatched from
.Fn nvso_ioctl
via
.Vt struct nvso_methods .
.Pp
.Em Rigorous aliases
(ioctl constant ↔ method):
.Bl -column "NVSSD_QUEUE_EXPORT" "nvssd_queue_export"
.It Dv NVSO_DOMAIN_CREATE Ta Fn nvso_domain_create
.It Dv NVSO_MAP Ta Fn nvso_map
.It Dv NVSSD_QUEUE_EXPORT Ta Fn nvssd_queue_export
.It Dv NVGPU_DMA_POST Ta Fn nvgpu_dma_post
.It Dv NVSO_DOMAIN_GATE Ta Fn nvso_domain_gate
.It Dv NVSO_IRQ_ATTACH Ta Fn nvso_irq_attach
.El
.Pp
SSD export and GPU DMA backends live in
.Pa nvso_ssd.c
and
.Pa nvso_gpu.c .
ABI 2 soft path: domain create/map/gate/irq and soft queue export / DMA post
return 0 (bookkeeping only). Real SSD/GPU DMA is not implemented.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Rv -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nvso 4
